\begin{remark}
\label{ch02-rem-neckpinch-pde}
\source{chow-knopf-ricci-flow:page-0054}
\dcref{Remark 2.18}
\group{neckpinch}

The \(s\)-derivative and time derivative do not commute; rather,
\([\partial_t,\partial_s]=-n(\psi_{ss}/\psi)\partial_s\).
\end{remark}
